        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Pisces &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Bloody Rose Blizzard &mdash; a storm of red roses, the garden released all at once.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area takes @Damage[6d8[piercing]] damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature that fails also takes @Damage[3d6[persistent,bleed]] damage.</p><p>The area fills with crimson petals for 1 minute: it is <strong>difficult terrain</strong>, and creatures inside are <strong>concealed</strong> from anyone outside and vice versa. You and your allies ignore both effects &mdash; you know where the roses are.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 and the persistent bleed damage by 1d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
